1
00:00:00,105 --> 00:00:03,275
(Howard:)Put her away,
'cause I don't have a third one.

2
00:00:03,275 --> 00:00:05,075
Yes!
Yes!

3
00:00:05,077 --> 00:00:06,077
(whoops)

4
00:00:06,078 --> 00:00:08,548
(Amy:)Rajesh eight, Penny four.

5
00:00:08,547 --> 00:00:10,547
(Leonard:)Sorry,
he's really good.

6
00:00:10,549 --> 00:00:12,679
(Bernadette:)Hey, Raj.

7
00:00:12,684 --> 00:00:13,914
(Bernadette:)if Howard can't
keep the TARDIS,

8
00:00:13,919 --> 00:00:15,549
(Bernadette:)how great would it
look at your place?

9
00:00:15,554 --> 00:00:16,554
(Leonard:)What?

10
00:00:16,555 --> 00:00:18,085
(Howard:)Yeah, what?

11
00:00:18,090 --> 00:00:20,420
(Bernadette:)I don't know much
about Doctor Who,

12
00:00:20,425 --> 00:00:22,425
(Bernadette:)but if, um, you were to put this

13
00:00:22,427 --> 00:00:26,427
(Bernadette:)right outside your front door
and open up the back,

14
00:00:26,431 --> 00:00:29,431
(Bernadette:)it would be like
your entire apartment was

15
00:00:29,434 --> 00:00:31,164
(Bernadette:)the inside of the TARDIS,

16
00:00:31,170 --> 00:00:32,940
(Bernadette:)which is pretty cool

17
00:00:32,938 --> 00:00:35,268
(Bernadette:)'cause on the show,
the inside of the TARDIS

18
00:00:35,274 --> 00:00:38,274
(Bernadette:)is bigger than the outside.

19
00:00:38,277 --> 00:00:42,017
(Bernadette:)But then again, I don't know
much about Doctor Who.

20
00:00:43,247 --> 00:00:44,917
(Howard:)Don't listen to her.

21
00:00:44,917 --> 00:00:47,587
(Howard:)You and I go way back--
we're like brothers.

22
00:00:48,553 --> 00:00:50,183
(Raj:)We are. We are.

23
00:00:50,189 --> 00:00:51,519
(clears throat)

24
00:00:51,523 --> 00:00:53,453
Oh, no!

25
00:00:53,458 --> 00:00:54,728
What a terrible serve!

26
00:00:56,894 --> 00:00:58,424
(Raj:)Sorry, brother.

27
00:00:58,430 --> 00:00:59,760
(Amy:)Eight-five.
This is ridiculous.

28
00:00:59,765 --> 00:01:01,095
(Howard:)I want a new champion.

